Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 08:28:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/15] foyelle: Foyelle banner and a foyelle command

The CLI banner shows the Foyelle wordmark and the package installs a
foyelle entry point next to hermes. Internal module names, HERMES_*
variables and the MIT notice are unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Mikael Rousson <85865+mmmikael@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 hermes_cli/banner.py | 12 ++++++------
 pyproject.toml       |  1 +
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

